<title>UK: Helaba unit adds 200 mln Swiss francs to 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Helaba unit adds 200 mln Swiss francs to 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was increased to 450 million Swiss francs from 250 million francs, lead manager CSFB, Zurich said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HELABA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE PLC, DUBLIN</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LB HESSEN THUERINGEN FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT  * 450 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY  **22.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.15    PAY DATE    22.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 IBCA	 AAA</p>
<p> NOTES    * ORIGINAL LAUNCHED 10.JUN.97</p>
<p>	   ** PLUS 30 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
